Z||000000||GT Bastard||07-14-2000||03:15 PM||||I was heading down to the auto parts store yesterday when I noticed an 1982ish Firebird T/A.  Faded paint, smashed door, rusty as hell, etc...  In the back window there were huge letters that read:  "!Lets Play!"  Repressing the need to play with them, I slowly pulled past them in the other lane.  About a car-length or so later, I hear their tired V8 roar and decide that they're trying to humiliate our almightly plastic friend.  So natually, I drop it in second, give them a nice screech, and began pulling away from them before they reached the back of my door. I slowed down and let them catch up.  Two idiots with backwards caps laying so far back in their seat that they can barely see over the dash.  Ugh....<P><P>------------------<BR>Gold 86 SE V6 4-sp w/4.10 gears, Eibach springs, Koni's all around w/some poly bushings<BR>Yoko's<BR>Coated headers<BR>ACT 4-puck clutch<BR>MSD ignition<BR>Flowmaster w/ mandrel bent 2.5 pipe<BR>extrude honed intake<BR>Lots of fuel system mods... etc etc...||||reg||1
Z||000001||Raydar||07-14-2000||04:49 PM||||You're having waaayyyyy too much fun with that car...<P>J/K<P><P>------------------<BR><BR>Raydar<BR>88 Formula T-Top <BR>88 Coupe (ISO 3800)<P>"Some mornings, it just isn't worth<BR>chewing through the restraints."||||reg||1
